activity Prepare Sample
activity Measure Hardness
activity Conduct Tensile Test
activity Evaluate Corrosion Resistance
activity Approve Material
activity Reject Material
activity Perform Thermal Analysis
activity Analyze Microstructure
activity Conduct X-ray Diffraction
activity Perform Chemical Analysis
activity Calibrate Equipment
activity Document Results
activity Review Findings
activity Prepare Report
bind Prepare Sample: Sample ID
bind Measure Hardness: Sample ID, Hardness Value
bind Conduct Tensile Test: Sample ID, Tensile Strength
bind Evaluate Corrosion Resistance: Sample ID, Corrosion Resistance
bind Approve Material: Sample ID, Approval Status
bind Reject Material: Sample ID
bind Perform Thermal Analysis: Sample ID, Thermal Conductivity
bind Analyze Microstructure: Sample ID, Microstructure Type
bind Conduct X-ray Diffraction: Sample ID, X-ray Intensity
bind Perform Chemical Analysis: Sample ID, Chemical Purity
bind Calibrate Equipment: Equipment Status
bind Document Results: Sample ID
bind Review Findings: Sample ID
bind Prepare Report: Sample ID
Sample ID: integer between 1 and 1000
Hardness Value: float between 0.0 and 100.0
Tensile Strength: float between 0.0 and 2000.0
Corrosion Resistance: High, Medium, Low
Approval Status: Approved, Rejected, Pending
Thermal Conductivity: float between 0.0 and 500.0
Microstructure Type: Grain, Fiber, Amorphous
X-ray Intensity: integer between 0 and 10000
Chemical Purity: float between 0.0 and 100.0
Equipment Status: Calibrated, Not Calibrated
Init[Prepare Sample] | |
End[Approve Material] | |
End[Reject Material] | |
Response[Conduct X-ray Diffraction, Analyze Microstructure] | |A.Sample ID == T.Sample ID |0,2,d
Chain Response[Measure Hardness, Conduct Tensile Test] | |A.Sample ID == T.Sample ID |0,1,d
Succession[Perform Thermal Analysis, Evaluate Corrosion Resistance] | |A.Sample ID == T.Sample ID |0,1,d
Precedence[Document Results, Review Findings] | |A.Sample ID == T.Sample ID |
Precedence[Approve Material, Review Findings] | |A.Sample ID == T.Sample ID |
Precedence[Reject Material, Review Findings] | |A.Sample ID == T.Sample ID |
Precedence[Document Results, Prepare Report] | |A.Sample ID == T.Sample ID |0,1,d
Precedence[Calibrate Equipment, Conduct X-ray Diffraction] |A.Equipment Status is Calibrated | |
Precedence[Calibrate Equipment, Measure Hardness] |A.Equipment Status is Calibrated | |
Precedence[Calibrate Equipment, Conduct Tensile Test] |A.Equipment Status is Calibrated | |
Precedence[Calibrate Equipment, Perform Thermal Analysis] |A.Equipment Status is Calibrated | |
Precedence[Calibrate Equipment, Evaluate Corrosion Resistance] |A.Equipment Status is Calibrated | |